L03.html:90: Let \(X\) be normal with mean zero and variance \(\Delta &gt; 0\). Then \(\E[X^2] = \Delta\), \(\E[X^4] = 3\Delta^2\), and \(\Var(X^2) = 2\Delta^2\).
